            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/493060/extras/4038206c4dcb49e20717be86365ec119.webp?t=1568850144\" width=225 height=25 /></span><br>Ballistic Tanks is the best tank game you've played since the 80's. Battle in exhilarating local multiplayer, or challenge yourself in an intense solo/co-op arcade mode. Play 5 game modes in over 50 maps; and destroy your enemies in a frenzy of bullets, lasers, and explosions!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/493060/extras/2c4a9b39df5abdebcadda64d45cc88ea.webp?t=1568850144\" width=225 height=25 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 50 different maps<br></li><li>Challenging solo or co-op arcade mode<br></li><li>4-player local multiplayer<br></li><li>Multiple game-changing power-ups<br></li><li>Various competitive game modes<br></li><li>4 controllers and keyboard support</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/493060/extras/9b35b837b7d0815f01622c6ec79f1580.webp?t=1568850144\" width=225 height=25 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Deathmatch</strong> - free for all brawl<br></li><li><strong>Juggernaut</strong> - become the Juggernaut!<br></li><li><strong>Powershift</strong> - random gameplay modifiers<br></li><li><strong>Arcade</strong> - solo or co-op against countless enemies<br></li><li><strong>Airstrike</strong> - planes and homing missiles</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/493060/extras/c691ce1e8dee393fac641aac1cd1b99e.avif?t=1568850144\" width=427 height=118 /></span>",
